# The death as the game makes it: `silenceAudio` and then the noise request
# $0B (M2RoS bank_000.asm:7937), over the surface theme, the low-health beep
# and a beam. Silence clears what was requested before it in the same tick
# and not what comes after, so the beam requested with it is dropped. Then
# the boot's `silenceAudio` (:10521) and the title song. Six seconds.
